                            <comment id="16298554" author="vozerov" created="Wed, 20 Dec 2017 14:11:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Cache should be cleared on the following events:&lt;br/&gt;
1) Cache destroy&lt;br/&gt;
2) Page eviction (PageMemoryImpl.Segment#evictPage)&lt;br/&gt;
3) Page update (FreeList.updateDataRow, FreeList.removeDataRowByLink)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To get number of elements on the page: &lt;tt&gt;DataPageIO.getDirectCount()&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
To understand if evicted page is data page: &lt;tt&gt;PageIO#getType(long) == T_DATA&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16303311" author="tledkov-gridgain" created="Mon, 25 Dec 2017 15:48:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;, please review the patch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
